      "chapter": "V. Population",
      "table_no": null,
      "title": "[Questions Asked on the Census Blank Concerning Each Individual]",
      "caption_extra": "Lead-in: \"As a preliminary, census blanks are distributed to each store and residence and the head of the house is required to fill them in as far as possible. The following questions are asked concerning each individual living in the house:\"",
      "continued": true,
      "parts": [
        {
          "label": null,
          "columns": [
            "Item"
          ],
          "rows": [
            [
              "1. Name."
            ],
            [
              "2. Sex. Marital condition, whether or not they have had any children."
            ],
            [
              "3. Age and birthday."
            ],
            [
              "4. Birth-place."
            ],
            [
              "5. Place of residence and how long they have lived there."
            ],
            [
              "6. Occupation."
            ],
            [
              "7. Religion."
            ],
            [
              "8. Education."
            ],
            [
              "9. Diseases and physical deformities."
            ],
            [
              "10. Number of years in Peking."
            ],
            [
              "11. Other necessary information."
            ]
          ]
        }
      ],
      "footnotes": [],
      "context": "Lists the eleven questions on the census blank that the head of each house in Peking was required to fill in for every individual living there, before the police collected and checked the blanks.",
      "transcriber_notes": [
        "Rows: 11 as printed (items 1-2 at the foot of p. 91, image p0105; items 3-11 at the top of p. 92, image p0106). Item numbers kept in the text as printed. Item 2 'Sex. Marital condition, whether or not they have had any children.' is one numbered item with a wrap line. No figures.",
        "Distinct from tables/p0106_1.json (the list of what the census boards report, 13 items) which is not duplicated here."
      ],
      "id": "p0105_1",
      "scans": [
