      "table_no": null,
      "title": "[Items Reported by the Census Boards]",
      "caption_extra": "Lead-in: \"The census blanks, when collected, are turned over to the different census boards. They tabulate the information and prepare the report for their district. This gives the numbers of the following:\"",
